[English - US]

1. When using the open-source project of this repository, you are prohibited from engaging in the following behaviors; any behavior not mentioned in these terms shall be deemed permitted.

2. You are prohibited from adding any content that violates the laws and regulations of your country or region, or any content harmful to society, during the modification of this project.

3. You are prohibited from distributing any of the following content to others in exchange for virtual items, virtual currency, legal tender, in-app currency of certain applications, or currency that requires spending money to obtain:
   1. The source code of this project;
   2. The artifacts of this project (compiled files);
   3. Your modified source code;
   4. Your compiled artifacts.

4. You are prohibited from distributing any content related to this project to others for commercial purposes.

5. You are prohibited from obtaining any form of profit through this project.

6. You are prohibited from using this project for any purpose that violates the laws and regulations of your country or region.

7. Any behavior not mentioned in these terms shall be deemed permitted; if these terms conflict with the laws and regulations of your country or region, the local laws and regulations shall prevail.

